OL,3,GNEWSAFree festival to bring
OL,4,A'world-class' acts to towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major arts festival will spread its
OL,7,Fwings to more towns this summer.
OL,9,FThe Freedom Festival will be held in
OL,10,FHull from 3 to 6 September, but will
OL,11,Falso stage free events in Grimsby,
OL,12,FGoole, Tadcaster and Bridlington
OL,13,Fbetween 31 August and 4 September.
OL,15,FThey will include a "gravity-defying"
OL,16,Fact called Spinsane, which involves
OL,17,Facrobats in a "wheel of death", and a
OL,18,Ffamily experience called Lilliput,
OL,19,Fwhere children can recreate classic
OL,20,Fstories.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
