OL,3,GNEWSAFree festival to bring
OL,4,A'world-class' acts to towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirector Phil Hargreaves said the tour
OL,7,Fwould allow more people to "experience
OL,8,Fthe energy and creativity of the
OL,9,Ffestival" by bringing "world-class
OL,10,Foutdoor work" into towns.
